## CoSpace API Requests
 
### get all bookings
GET http://localhost:5000/bookings
Authorization: super-secret-key
### get one booking
GET http://localhost:5000/bookings/1
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
### get one booking paginated
GET http://localhost:5000/bookings?page=2&limit=2
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
### get one booking paginated
GET http://localhost:5000/bookings?page=1&limit=999
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
### throw bad request
GET http://localhost:5000/error

### throw application error
GET  http://localhost:5000/boom-app-error
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
### throw unexpected error
GET  http://localhost:5000/boom-unexpected
# Authorization: super-secret-key
 
### create booking
POST http://localhost:5000/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
{"desk_id": 1, "booking_date": "2026-09-29", "active": true}
 
### create booking
PUT http://localhost:5000/bookings/102 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json"
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
{"name": "Desk 102", "booked": "false"}
 
### update booking
PATCH http://localhost:5000/bookings/102 HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json"
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
{"booked": "false"}
 
### delete booking
DELETE http://localhost:5000/bookings/102 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
### Add user
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
{"first_name":"John","last_name":"Doe","email":"john.doe@example.com","password":"securepassword","team_id":1}
 
### Login
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/login HTTP/1.1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
{"email":"john.doe@example.com","password":"securepassword"}
 
### create booking
POST http://localhost:5000/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer super-secret-key
Authorization: super-secret-key
 
{
  "desk_id": 1,
  "booking_date": "2026-09-29",
  "active": true
}
 
### create booking
POST http://localhost:5000/bookings
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer super-secret-key
Authorization: super-secret-key
{
  "desk_id": 2,
  "booking_date": "2026-11-29",
  "active": true
}

### throw forbidden error - 403
GET http://localhost:5000/boom-forbidden 